---
import { ArrowDown, ArrowRight } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<figure class="project-memory-overview not-prose" aria-labelledby="project-memory-overview-title">
  <div class="overview-heading">
    <h3 id="project-memory-overview-title">A correction needs an address—and a caretaker</h3>
    <span class="figure-label">Overview · unnumbered</span>
  </div>

  <div class="overview-grid">
    <section class="stage">
      <p class="figure-label">Conversation</p>
      <p class="figure-node-prominent">The correction is clear now</p>
      <p class="figure-copy">A claim is narrowed, a requirement changes, or a trade-off is settled.</p>
      <p class="boundary figure-support">The next session may not inherit the exchange.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="flow" aria-hidden="true">
      <ArrowDown class="flow-mobile" size={16} strokeWidth={1.6} />
      <ArrowRight class="flow-desktop" size={16} strokeWidth={1.6} />
    </div>

    <section class="stage is-memory">
      <span class="stage-bar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="figure-label figure-accent">Durable, scoped addresses</p>
      <p class="figure-node-prominent">Record intent; inspect evidence</p>
      <p class="figure-copy">Memory: constitution · specification · plan · tasks · decision record</p>
      <p class="evidence-line figure-meta">Evidence: implementation · tests</p>
      <p class="boundary figure-support">Each answers a different question. No universal precedence is implied.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="flow" aria-hidden="true">
      <ArrowDown class="flow-mobile" size={16} strokeWidth={1.6} />
      <ArrowRight class="flow-desktop" size={16} strokeWidth={1.6} />
    </div>

    <section class="stage">
      <p class="figure-label">Later task</p>
      <p class="figure-node-prominent">Route, inspect, reconcile</p>
      <p class="figure-copy">Select relevant records, inspect implementation evidence, expose disagreement, and maintain each owner.</p>
      <p class="boundary figure-support">Selection is explicit today—not an automated relevance engine.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="qualifications">
    <p class="figure-meta">Addressable ≠ authoritative</p>
    <p class="figure-meta">Persistent ≠ current</p>
    <p class="figure-meta">Selected ≠ understood</p>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    Project memory improves recoverability; implementation and tests provide adjacent evidence of what exists and what was checked. None is automatically correct, current, universally authoritative, or read by every agent.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .project-memory-overview {
    margin: 2.25rem 0 2.75rem;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .project-memory-overview :global(h3),
  .project-memory-overview :global(p) {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .overview-heading {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .overview-heading h3 {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .overview-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  .stage {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .stage > .figure-node-prominent {
    margin-top: 0.7rem !important;
  }

  .stage > .figure-copy {
    margin-top: 0.55rem !important;
  }

  .evidence-line {
    margin-top: 0.55rem !important;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  .stage.is-memory {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: 1.1rem 1rem;
  }

  .stage-bar {
    position: absolute;
    inset-block: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .boundary {
    margin-top: 0.85rem !important;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: 0.65rem;
  }

  .flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .flow-desktop {
    display: none;
  }

  .qualifications {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1px;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .qualifications p {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .project-memory-overview {
      padding: 1.75rem 0;
    }

    .overview-heading h3 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .overview-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) 2.5rem minmax(0, 1.15fr) 2.5rem minmax(0, 0.95fr);
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .stage:first-child {
      padding-right: 1.5rem;
    }

    .stage:last-child {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .stage.is-memory {
      padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .flow-mobile {
      display: none;
    }

    .flow-desktop {
      display: block;
    }

    .qualifications {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
